 4/HTX-Event-Launch-Kit-CCS-TCG-Con-X-1.jpg
UID:HFyICz8-QSrve_rNRvqh5
SUMMARY:Houston TCG Con X
DTSTAMP:20260808T091829Z
DTSTART:20260807T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:💥 Houston… Round X: From one to ten – What a pull it’s been! 🎉\
	n🎴 Three Days • FREE Entry • 100+ Vendors • Nonstop Trades! \nWhat started
	 as a small weekend card show has turned into a full-on collector movement
	. Houston TCG Con is back at CCS with Round X: a full 3-day weekend built 
	on trades\, collecting\, and community. More time to dig. More time to tra
	de. More time to find something you didn’t even know you needed. 🃏🤝 \n  \n
	📅 Date: August 7-9\, 2026 \n⏰ Time: Friday: 3PM – 10PM | Saturday: 10AM – 
	6PM | Sunday: 10AM – 5PM \n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston
	\, TX 77036 \n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking! \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 1
	00+ TCG Vendors — The Houston Trade Floor\nShop from 100+ curated vendors 
	from across Texas and beyond. Tables will be stacked with: \n✅ Top titles 
	including Pokémon\, Magic: The Gathering\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, One Piece\, Lorcana
	\, Digimon\, Weiss Schwarz\, and more. \n✅ Sealed product + booster boxes 
	\n✅ Graded slabs + collector singles \n✅ Binder deals + playable staples \
	n✅ Japanese imports + hard-to-find pickups \n✅ Sleeves\, top loaders\, sto
	rage & accessories \n  \n⚡ Buy • Sell • Trade — All Weekend\nThis is what 
	Houston TCG Con is known for. Bring your binders\, make the deals you’ve b
	een waiting for\, and connect with collectors. This is where grails change
	 hands and collections level up. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Car
	d Restorations — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking about gr
	ading? Or one that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-si
	te helping collectors with grading submissions\, restoration services\, an
	d expert insight all weekend. \n  \n🤝 Built by the Community — 10 Rounds S
	trong\nFrom first packs opened around the kitchen table to the cards you s
	till chase today\, this is where it all comes back. The trades\, the stori
	es\, the people you meet along the way\, Round X is a milestone for everyo
	ne who grew up with the hobby and never really left it. Bring your crew (a
	nd your binder) and relive it with us. Houston TCG Con X is back for a big
	ger weekend\, with the same community that’s always made it feel like home
	. \n  \n🎨 Face Painting Fun | Saturday\nStep away from the tables and add 
	some extra style to your TCG Con experience with fun face painting designs
	. ✨ By @will.and.whimsy \n  \n💼 Vendors – Claim Your Spot!\nApply here 👉🏻 h
	ttps://tinyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \nThis is your chance to connect with the
	 passionate Charlie’s Collectible Show TCG Community! \n  \n🏨 Exclusive Ho
	tel Accommodation\nThinking of traveling to Houston for our show? We’ve re
	served a special hotel deal just for you: $79/night rate at TownePlace Sui
	tes – just 15 minutes away from CCS Houston. \n🔗 Book your stay: Here \n  
	\n❤️ Houston TCG community… this is what we built together.\n\nhttps://ccs-
	houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-x/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-x/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT55H
END:VEVENT
