UID:QqV5ijAy3w7J8zw2754If
SUMMARY:Member Appreciation Pool Party
DTSTAMP:20260808T091829Z
DTSTART:20260809T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for one last splash before school is back in session! G
	et ready for a morning of pool fun\, complete with music\, foam\, snow con
	es\, pool games and more.\nWe can’t wait to celebrate the end of summer wi
