UID:NGcdyOegiAE0dEgbawyV5
SUMMARY:Retro Video Game Expo III
DTSTAMP:20260808T091829Z
DTSTART:20260815T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🕹️ Houston\, Press Start on a Weekend of Pure Retro Nostalgia! 👾
	\nStep back into the golden era of gaming at Retro Video Game Expo III\, a
	 two-day celebration of classic consoles\, arcade legends\, competitive re
	tro tournaments\, and nonstop free play. From expanded free-play zones spa
	nning the 80s and beyond to live\, high-energy tournament matchups and a c
	ollector-focused marketplace\, this expo is built for gamers who chase hig
	h scores and grail finds. \n  \n🗓️ Date & Time: August 15–16\, 2026 | 10AM–
	5PM\n📍 Location: 9700 Bissonnet St #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036\n💥 FREE ENTR
	Y. FREE PARKING. FREE PLAY. \n  \n🎮 Event Highlights\n🎮 Retro Video Game M
	arketplace – All Weekend\nStep into a collector’s paradise. Vendors from a
	cross the region are bringing vintage consoles\, original cartridges\, imp
	orts\, manuals\, accessories\, and hard-to-find titles. This is where trea
	sures respawn. \n🚨 Want to vend? Sign up here 👉 https://tinyurl.com/Housto
	nVendors \n  \n👾 Free-Play Zone – Both Days | ALL Day\nJump on 80’s Arcade
	s & Classic Consoles and relive the games that made gaming legendary. More
	 setups and activities to be announced soon! \n  \n🎸 Retro Video Game Musi
	c: One-Man Live Show – Saturday & Sunday | 12PM–2PM\nTake a break from the
	 consoles and jam out to a live solo performance of your favorite video ga
	me soundtracks. Bust some dance moves to guitar and keyboard covers of cla
	ssic tracks from Sega\, Super Mario Bros.\, Metal Gear Solid\, Street Figh
	ter II & III\, Tekken 3\, Chrono Trigger\, Final Fantasy\, Tetris\, Rayxan
	ber II\, and more. ✨ Hosted by @Voe2pt0 \n  \n🕹️ Retro Madness Gaming Stati
	on – Both Days | All Day\nFree play? All day. Challenge your friends to a 
	round of classic GameCube titles. Prefer GTA or Minecraft? They’re here to
	o! Grab a controller and play as long as you want! ✨ Hosted by @hunnypotpr
	oject \n  \n🃏 UNO Tournament – Saturday | 12PM–5PM\nGet ready for fast-pac
	ed UNO action! Join Kung Fu Eddy for a tournament filled with strategy\, s
	urprises\, and friendly competition. Players will battle through rounds us
	ing classic UNO rules with special twists\, including advanced rules\, UNO
	 Flip semifinals\, and a mystery deck championship match. Don’t want to co
	mpete? A casual play table will be available for anyone who wants to jump 
	in and have fun! ✨ Hosted by @kungfueddybaybee \n  \n🏨 Special Hotel Deals
	\nEnjoy a special rate of $79/night — 2 Queens at TownePlace Suites\, only
	 15 minutes away from the action!\nBook your stay 👉🏻 https://www.marriott.c
	om/event-reservations/reservation-link.mi?id=1767823967549&key=CORP&app=re
	svlink \n  \nBring your crew\, grab a controller\, and let’s relive the go
	lden age of gaming together. 👾\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/retro-vid
	eo-game-expo-iii/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/retro-video-game-expo-iii/
