	Steady Games at CCS Houston for the Magic: The Gathering: Reality Fracture
	 Prerelease\, your first opportunity to play with the newest Magic set bef
	ore its worldwide release. Build a Sealed deck from your Prerelease Pack\,
	 explore Jace’s Echoverse\, and discover reimagined versions of familiar c
	haracters as the fate of the Multiverse hangs in the balance. \n  \n🗓️ Sept
	ember 25\, 2026\n📍9700 Bissonnet St\, #1500\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nEve
	nt Overview:\n\nFormat: Sealed\nTournament Structure: Swiss\nExpected Numb
	er of Rounds: 3\nPlayer Capacity: 30\nEntry: $30\nSign Up: On-Site\n\n  \n
	💰 Prize Pool:\n\nOne Reality Fracture booster pack per match win\n\n  \n📋 
	Registration Details:\n\nRegistration Opens: 6:00 PM\nTournament Begins: 7
	:00 PM\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/mtg-reality-fracture-pre-release-
	event/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
